é
In feature writing 经 probably told to create an arc 索r protag¬
onist that takes him from one state to its opposite; the character struggles
toward‰ goal and once 符 attained, your story ends. Someone who is
unable to love is changed when a mate/child/friend appear‰nd, through
fighting the relationship, the character is finally able to love. Or someone
who 最 wronged seeks revenge and either achieves it or dies ü
